Value Required LOCAL_INTERFACE ((?:GE|XGE|Eth-Trunk|GigabitEthernet|XGigabitEthernet|Ten-GigabitEthernet)\s*\S+)
Value Required NEIGHBOR_NAME (\S+)
Value Required NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE ((?:GE|XGE|Eth-Trunk|GigabitEthernet|XGigabitEthernet|Ten-GigabitEthernet)\s*\S+)
Value EXPIRED_TIME (\d+)

Start
  ^<[^>]+>.*$$
  ^Local\s+Interface\s+Exptime\(s\)\s+Neighbor\s+Interface\s+Neighbor\s+Device\s*$$
  ^Local\s+Intf\s+Neighbor\s+Dev\s+Neighbor\s+Intf\s+Exptime\(s\)\s*$$
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${EXPIRED_TIME}\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s+${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s+${EXPIRED_TIME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*-+\s*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error
